review_language_errors.pas:29:10: error: `New` needs a constructor here, but `TShape.Draw` isn't one
  New(p, Draw);
         ^^^^

review_language_errors.pas:30:14: error: `Dispose` needs a destructor here, but `TShape.Init` isn't one
