        ^

review_language_errors.pas:34:18: error: `p` is passed by `var` more than once in this call to `PtrAndField`; Rust doesn't allow two mutable references to the same variable; how to rewrite it: https://github.com/jjinux/pascrust/blob/main/docs/rust_limits.md#two-var-arguments
